# Define v1 schema + examples — Command Palette / Help Overlay

## Goal
Create a JSON schema for the contribution type and ship 2-3 example payloads in a demo add-in.

## Guardrails
- **No executable add-in runtime**: add-ins contribute only static files (JSON/MD/assets).
- Keep changes **generic** (capability-slot based), no provider-specific kernel code.
- Must be **reversible**: disable/uninstall removes effect and restores defaults safely.
- Public repo friendly: no secrets, no org-specific assumptions.

## Deliverables
- Implementation (smallest viable change)
- Schema (v1) + at least 1 example payload in a demo add-in
- Tests covering: valid payload, invalid payload, missing payload, disabled add-in

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Feature works end-to-end with a demo add-in installed
- [ ] Invalid add-in payload fails safely with clear error reporting
- [ ] Disable/uninstall reverses the effect (no orphan state)
- [ ] Unit/integration tests pass
